**Projected seats** ([+ projected_majority_line +] for a majority)

Conservative [+ con_seats +], Labour [+ lab_seats +], [+ lib_name +] [+ lib_seats +], SNP [+ snp_seats +], Plaid [+ pc_seats +], Northern Ireland [+ ni_seats +]

[? if con_seats >= projected_majority_line : Projected result: Conservative majority. ?][? if lab_seats >= projected_majority_line : Projected result: Labour majority. ?][? if con_seats < projected_majority_line and lab_seats < projected_majority_line : Projected result: hung parliament. ?]

**Support by social grade**

Professional & managerial (AB): Con [+ ab_con_display +]%, Lab [+ ab_lab_display +]%, Lib [+ ab_lib_display +]%

